Subject: [PATCH 0001] Register the custom Prism.* DevTools domain

Wires prism/pdl/prism.pdl into the browser protocol build and registers
PrismDomainHandler on browser-target sessions (AttachSession):
- devtools/BUILD.gn: concatenate prism.pdl; generate protocol/prism.{cc,h}
- protocol_config.json: list all 12 Prism commands (the generator only
  emits domains configured here)
- content/browser/BUILD.gn: compile the handler from //prism, dep on
  //prism:prism, and compile the GENERATED prism.cc into the browser
  target (missing this is a link error)
- browser_devtools_agent_host.cc: CreateAndAddHandler in AttachSession

Handler code lives in //prism (src-overlay). Verified with git apply
--check against pin 151.0.7922.174.

diff --git a/content/browser/devtools/BUILD.gn b/content/browser/devtools/BUILD.gn
index c55c623..a1d5e87 100644
--- a/content/browser/devtools/BUILD.gn
+++ b/content/browser/devtools/BUILD.gn
@@ -80,6 +80,11 @@ action("concatenate_protocols") {
     args += [ rebase_path(native_profiling_pdl, root_build_dir) ]
   }
 
+  # Prism: fold the custom Prism.* domain into the browser protocol.
+  _prism_pdl = "//prism/pdl/prism.pdl"
+  inputs += [ _prism_pdl ]
+  args += [ rebase_path(_prism_pdl, root_build_dir) ]
+
   args += [ rebase_path(output_file, root_build_dir) ]
 }
 
@@ -137,6 +142,8 @@ inspector_protocol_generate("protocol_sources") {
     "protocol/page.h",
     "protocol/preload.cc",
     "protocol/preload.h",
+    "protocol/prism.cc",
+    "protocol/prism.h",
     "protocol/protocol.h",
     "protocol/runtime.cc",
     "protocol/runtime.h",
